<title>GERMANY: RWE 9-month net profit up 6.8 pct.</title>
<headline>RWE 9-month net profit up 6.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to March 31</p>
<p>	   (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   878     vs 822</p>
<p>    Group sales				  52,932  vs 49,103</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German utility, engineering and telecommunications group is RWE AG. The company said start-up costs for its telecommunications business had risen significantly, as expected. It also said the rise in nine-month earnings stemmed mainly from its engineering and plant construction activities.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
